seekwright check
================
config      check_probe_gap.toml  (present)
default     none (a bare search walks the free set)
permitted   (unset: every enabled provider)
providers
  enabled   exa:free, searxng
  effective exa:free, searxng
  built     exa:free, searxng
  untested  exa:free, searxng are untested on this port: no live verification against the real endpoint has happened in the OCaml build, and a reachability probe is not one
  exa:free  no connectivity probe  unbilled
  searxng   unreachable            unbilled
  probes    no connectivity probe on this port for: exa:free -- built here, and their readiness is the MCP handshake at warmup
no providers ready -- searches would fail until configured
fetch
  enabled   40000 chars max, 3 redirects, private addresses blocked
  primary   http (the local reader)
  extractor stdlib
  cache     off
agent
  disabled in config
